<title>FRANCE: Saint-Gobain stake in Suez rises.</title>
<headline>Saint-Gobain stake in Suez rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saint-Gobain holds 10.3 million shares in Cie de Suez, representing 6.29 percent of the capital and 10.3 percent of the voting rights, the French stockmarkets association SBF said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said Saint-Gobain disclosed that its voting rights had risen above 10 percent last month as a result of dividend payments made in shares and a doubling of the voting rights on its Suez shares held more than two years.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
